From 121f6db8d6da35854cf3c6f550bafc84135483e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritvik <ritvik2014@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:20:10 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 31/40] screenshot UI: the island's glass panel,
 area/window/screen modes, vim keys

The help panel is a liquid glass card (the island's open card, its values
from ~/.config/niri/glass.json written by dotnix theme/niri-glass.py) with
the modes, pointer and capture as glass controls (layer 2). a/w/s pick the
mode; hjkl moves the area or jumps between windows, Shift+hjkl resizes, y
copies, Enter/Space saves, p toggles the pointer, q/Esc cancels. The
liquid glass renderer is now a Glass type niri's own UI can use too.
---
 niri-config/src/binds.rs           |  10 +
 src/input/mod.rs                   |  12 +
 src/layout/monitor.rs              |  23 +
 src/niri.rs                        |  33 +-
 src/protocols/lumen_glass.rs       |   2 +-
 src/render_helpers/liquid_glass.rs | 343 ++++++-----
 src/ui/screenshot_ui.rs            | 902 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 7 files changed, 1026 insertions(+), 299 deletions(-)

